{"words": [{"text": "۞ إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّفَا", "translation": "the Safa"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَرْوَةَ", "translation": "and the Marwah"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "(are) from"}, {"text": "شَعَآئِرِ", "translation": "(the) symbols"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۖ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "فَمَنْ", "translation": "So whoever"}, {"text": "حَجَّ", "translation": "performs Hajj"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيْتَ", "translation": "(of) the House"}, {"text": "أَوِ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "ٱعْتَمَرَ", "translation": "performs Umrah"}, {"text": "فَلَا", "translation": "so no"}, {"text": "جُنَاحَ", "translation": "blame"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِ", "translation": "on him"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "يَطَّوَّفَ", "translation": "he walks"}, {"text": "بِهِمَا ۚ", "translation": "between [both of] them"}, {"text": "وَمَن", "translation": "And whoever"}, {"text": "تَطَوَّعَ", "translation": "voluntarily does"}, {"text": "خَيْرًۭا", "translation": "good"}, {"text": "فَإِنَّ", "translation": "then indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "شَاكِرٌ", "translation": "(is) All-Appreciative"}, {"text": "عَلِيمٌ", "translation": "All-Knowing"}], "sahih": "Indeed, aṣ-Ṣafā and al-Marwah are among the symbols1 of Allāh. So whoever makes ḥajj [pilgrimage] to the House or performs ʿumrah - there is no blame upon him for walking between them.2 And whoever volunteers good - then indeed, Allāh is Appreciative3 and Knowing."}